{"scenario": {"window_size": "1440x900", "lsp": {"typescript": "fixtures/lsp/review_intel_stacked_ts.json"}, "description": "A Tailwind v4 project without its language server (PLAN §18.4, §18.5): TypeScript starts, Tailwind CSS shows as missing in the status bar (under automation only DV_LSP_<ID> finds servers), its details say why and how to get it (bun add -g @tailwindcss/language-server, or npm's) and offer Check again, which looks again (`intel.rechecks`; still missing here); a hover shows TypeScript's answer alone; a screenshot of the details."}}
